# PR Language Format

When preparing, proposing, creating, or editing a pull request:

- Keep PR titles in English
- Keep PR headings in English
- Keep checklist items in English
- Keep descriptive body content in Russian
- Preserve repository PR templates, but translate free-form description text to Russian

Before showing a PR draft to the user or calling `gh pr create` / `gh pr edit`, do a final language check:

- English: title, section headings, checkbox labels
- Russian: summary paragraphs, change descriptions, testing details, notes

Do not submit a PR draft until this language split has been verified.
